<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

45
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

46
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

47
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the heck are you, mister?</font>

48
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a Delivery Ninja!</font>

49
00:02:45,390 --> 00:02:51,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Please ♥ Mister Postman</font>

50
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">23, 24, 25...</font>

51
00:02:55,270 --> 00:02:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">26...</font>

52
00:02:56,940 --> 00:02:58,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake...</font>

53
00:02:58,740 --> 00:03:02,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to you, Mister Naruto,
all of the postal articles are safe.</font>

54
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, what's a Delivery Ninja?</font>

55
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are postal professionals
who risk our lives</font>

56
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to deliver the important parcels
our customers have left with us.</font>

57
00:03:12,670 --> 00:03:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, you're a postman.</font>

58
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a Delivery Ninja!</font>

59
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ordinary postmen don't risk their lives.</font>

60
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're an awesome postman, huh?</font>

61
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

62
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oops, I must not keep
my customers waiting.</font>

63
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I'll be on my way...</font>

64
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mister! What's your name?!</font>

65
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm 596-03.</font>

66
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:37,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A zip code...?!</font>

67
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anywhere would be fine
if I can get in a hot spring...</font>

68
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cripes...
Here it's still day time and...</font>

69
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That voice...</font>

70
00:03:55,790 --> 00:03:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My, you're a strange one, Jira-Chan.</font>

71
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I?</font>

72
00:04:01,170 --> 00:04:03,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, Pervy Sage!</font>

73
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:06,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Who's a Pervy Sage...?!</font>

74
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this,
Pervy Sage?!</font>

75
00:04:13,850 --> 00:04:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hadn't you left the village
on an important mission?</font>

76
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I was being patient
about you training with me!</font>

77
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you've got free time
to be doing this,</font>

78
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">help out with my training right now!</font>

79
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto.
There's a reason for this...</font>

80
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You probably have some glib lies
about gathering information.</font>

81
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong, you're wrong.
It's data collection, data collection...</font>

82
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You see...</font>

83
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my final spurt</font>

84
00:04:37,750 --> 00:04:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the manuscript of the final volume
of "Make-Out Violence."</font>

85
00:04:40,210 --> 00:04:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about the mission...?</font>

86
00:04:42,550 --> 00:04:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you see, I'm on a mission.</font>

87
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, don't worry...</font>

88
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:50,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of mission?</font>

89
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As it happens, I received information
that a member of the Akatsuki Organization</font>

90
00:04:56,440 --> 00:05:00,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will be visiting this town
the day after tomorrow.</font>

91
00:05:00,230 --> 00:05:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Akatsuki Organization!
Then, that Itachi will be...?</font>

92
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know that.
And the same goes for their purpose...</font>

93
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's a matter until
the day after tomorrow.</font>

94
00:05:11,450 --> 00:05:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so, I'm making effective use
of the free time!</font>

95
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it's perfect.
Give me some training!</font>

96
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... you see, they're so insistent
about the manuscript.</font>

97
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I ended up promising the publisher
that I'd send it today or tomorrow.</font>

98
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:32,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! It's a long-awaited chance
for training.</font>

99
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If my manuscript were
to be completed early,</font>

100
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:37,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might be able to take
some time for training.</font>

101
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my shoulders are stiff!</font>

102
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There, there.</font>

103
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'm thirsty!</font>

104
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go.</font>

105
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot!</font>

106
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, the ideas I just about had
have blown away!</font>

107
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:05,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough!</font>

108
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm taking a bath!</font>

109
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a hard Sensei to please...</font>

110
00:06:15,890 --> 00:06:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet he's going to say
this is data collection, anyway.</font>

111
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must deliver that secret document</font>

112
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the Land of Fangs,
no matter what the cost...</font>

113
00:06:24,030 --> 00:06:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems this is where
the Delivery Ninja always stay.</font>

114
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, they could...</font>

115
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delivery Ninja?</font>

116
00:06:31,530 --> 00:06:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see them now.</font>

117
00:06:34,950 --> 00:06:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is all I need for
my writing desire to well up...</font>

118
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not getting... inspired with this...</font>

119
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Imagining with your head
is a writer's job, isn't it?</font>

120
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a writer rooted in realism!
Getting a picture is important.</font>

121
00:06:53,930 --> 00:06:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I wonder if you'd do that for me.</font>

122
00:06:55,770 --> 00:06:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you write if I do that?</font>

123
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll write, I'll write!</font>

124
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sexy Jutsu:
Steam Bath Harem Version!</font>

125
00:07:08,950 --> 00:07:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Master Jiraiya. Jiraiya!
— This is great!</font>

126
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Won-der-ful!</font>

127
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:25,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a hopeless guy!</font>

128
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He hasn't been able to write at all!</font>

129
00:07:49,990 --> 00:07:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Address, check!
Zip code, check...!</font>

130
00:08:01,290 --> 00:08:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, the sealed documents...</font>

131
00:08:07,710 --> 00:08:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take extra care with this.</font>

132
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take it for you.</font>

133
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me, can I also ask you
to take this for me?</font>

134
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:23,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mister Naruto.
Thank you for helping me out yesterday.</font>

135
00:08:23,810 --> 00:08:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mister!</font>

136
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:30,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am 596-03.</font>

137
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard to remember!</font>

138
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, I want to ask you
to take care of this!</font>

139
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This goes in a different direction...</font>

140
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have a heart. Please.</font>

141
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:45,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, perfect timing.</font>

142
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this a Shadow Clone?</font>

143
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is 463-72.</font>

144
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:55,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This area should be in your jurisdiction.</font>

145
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is.</font>

146
00:08:57,430 --> 00:09:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I leave it to you...
What was it again?</font>

147
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am 463-72.</font>

148
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:06,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry, okay?</font>

149
00:09:10,070 --> 00:09:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake up...</font>

150
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I fell asleep!</font>

151
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage, let's start training!</font>

152
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about?
I must complete the manuscript...</font>

153
00:09:22,330 --> 00:09:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to worry
about that.</font>

154
00:09:25,210 --> 00:09:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wrote the manuscript
and sent it to the publisher!</font>

155
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, now you can devote
yourself freely to training...</font>

156
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Pervy Sage?</font>

157
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

158
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:39,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If something like this were read,
it'll be the end of my writing career!</font>

159
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

160
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:46,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said you sent it to
the publisher, right? How?</font>

161
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:49,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave it to a Delivery Ninja
in the inn...</font>

162
00:09:49,310 --> 00:09:51,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delivery Ninja.</font>

163
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean, the one that delivers any
parcel to the addressee, no matter what...</font>

164
00:09:56,820 --> 00:10:01,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not influenced by any land or
institution... that iron organization?!</font>

165
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:03,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After him, Naruto.</font>

166
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll chase down the Delivery Ninja,
no matter what...</font>

167
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and retrieve your manuscript
at any cost!</font>

168
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he's going to the publisher,
he should definitely take this path.</font>

169
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:26,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now what's left is how to
close the time gap...</font>

170
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear the leg power of Delivery Ninja
is extraordinary, though...</font>

171
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage!</font>

172
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slow down the pace a little, man.</font>

173
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! This is also training!</font>

174
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be straight, you're short on leg power!</font>

175
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja must apply oneself,</font>

176
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">connecting this with training,
no matter what the situation!</font>

177
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent, Pervy Sage.
Now you're talking!</font>

178
00:10:55,900 --> 00:10:58,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like a maze!</font>

179
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're totally lost...</font>

180
00:11:00,500 --> 00:11:03,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we had Hinata's or Neji's Byakugan
at a time like this...</font>

181
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan! I didn't think of that!</font>

182
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:11,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Rasengan, isn't it?!</font>

183
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry!</font>

184
00:11:28,350 --> 00:11:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, no, you see...!</font>

185
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time to be drooling!</font>

186
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is!</font>

187
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After him, Naruto.</font>

188
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

189
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thieves!</font>

190
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait!</font>

191
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no fool who'd wait
after being told to wait!</font>

192
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As it happens,</font>

193
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the parcel this person here
left with you this morning is a slip-up!</font>

194
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

195
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no knowledge of that.</font>

196
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rule for us Delivery Ninja</font>

197
00:12:02,070 --> 00:12:03,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is to deliver parcels to the destination,</font>

198
00:12:03,950 --> 00:12:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if we have to risk our lives!</font>

199
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My life as a writer is also at risk!</font>

200
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look at me.</font>

201
00:12:08,030 --> 00:12:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is trouble!</font>

202
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

203
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To do that to someone
who's doing honest work...</font>

204
00:12:22,450 --> 00:12:25,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! When you get right down to it,
it was you who...</font>

205
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

206
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the thing you wrote!</font>

207
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That time! It got switched with
my manuscript!</font>

208
00:12:37,850 --> 00:12:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

209
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... a secret document directed</font>

210
00:12:42,350 --> 00:12:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the feudal lord of the Land of Fangs
from the Land of Claws...</font>

211
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see...
According to the information I've gotten,</font>

212
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Fang and the Claw could go
to war at any moment...</font>

213
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a secret document for peace!</font>

214
00:12:55,860 --> 00:12:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've decided on peace?!
It's written here.</font>

215
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a good thing, isn't it?!
War is no good!</font>

216
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! You idiot! The fact that
this secret document is here means</font>

217
00:13:07,250 --> 00:13:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the manuscript you wrote is being taken
to the Land of Fangs!</font>

218
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What'll happen if they read it as
a secret document</font>

219
00:13:14,550 --> 00:13:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the Land of Claws?</font>

220
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad! No doubt, war will begin!</font>

221
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to the Land of Fangs!</font>

222
00:13:22,180 --> 00:13:23,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

223
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:25,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time for sure we'll take back
the manuscript!</font>

224
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Postal thieves...
my customer's important parcel...!</font>

225
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:45,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

226
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is 463-72. This is 463-72!</font>

227
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A postal robbery has occurred!</font>

228
00:13:53,950 --> 00:13:56,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thieves are a pair,</font>

229
00:13:56,050 --> 00:13:57,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a large man with a perverted look
and a kid!</font>

230
00:13:58,020 --> 00:14:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They appear to be after 596-03's parcel.</font>

231
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Members in the area are assigned
to protect 596-03!</font>

232
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop the thieves in the name
of the Delivery Ninja!</font>

233
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only way to get to the Land of Fangs
is to go up this river.</font>

234
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than likely they will also go
by boat.</font>

235
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then depending on our speed,
there's a chance we'll catch up.</font>

236
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one who's got it rough.</font>

237
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have enough physical strength!</font>

238
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Consider this also as training
and apply yourself!</font>

239
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:37,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That again?!</font>

240
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're those guys?!</font>

241
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears reinforcements
have been summoned.</font>

242
00:14:55,070 --> 00:14:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry, Naruto!</font>

243
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Switch places!</font>

244
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

245
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

246
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somehow... the Rasengan looks like
a really cheap Jutsu...</font>

247
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:35,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for the sake of preventing a war!</font>

248
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our mission of peace is at stake!</font>

249
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Switch.</font>

250
00:15:44,650 --> 00:15:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

251
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

252
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

253
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

254
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

255
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait! It's a slip-up!
This is the real one!</font>

256
00:16:03,620 --> 00:16:06,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They got switched during the commission!</font>

257
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delivery Ninja old man,
it's the truth!</font>

258
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:12,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

259
00:16:12,910 --> 00:16:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to our rule,
we are never to look inside</font>

260
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a customer's parcel we have taken on,
no matter what.</font>

261
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that passes over to the Land of Fangs,</font>

262
00:16:21,410 --> 00:16:23,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there will be war!</font>

263
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if that were the case,
I must not break the rule.</font>

264
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:29,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're impossible!</font>

265
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the Land of Fangs!</font>

266
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:40,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All we do is carry out our duties!</font>

267
00:16:40,990 --> 00:16:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... we'll take it away
by force if we have to.</font>

268
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Postal delivery!
— Postal delivery!</font>

269
00:16:49,530 --> 00:16:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Do you know which one it is?!</font>

270
00:16:51,570 --> 00:16:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I don't!</font>

271
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am 596-03.</font>

272
00:16:57,840 --> 00:17:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know! It's 596-03!</font>

273
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is he?!</font>

274
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up there!</font>

275
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you hold back the front!
I'll rout the rest!</font>

276
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

277
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you go past here!</font>

278
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the name of the Delivery Ninja,</font>

279
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:36,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not let anyone interfere!</font>

280
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:38,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an impressive old man...</font>

281
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, too, in the name of the Leaf Ninja,</font>

282
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will take away the manuscript
with a Jutsu!</font>

283
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

284
00:17:46,290 --> 00:17:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Harem Jutsu! Riverside Mad Dance!</font>

285
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mis-ter De-Li-very Nin-ja.</font>

286
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no! This isn't the time to be
doing something like this.</font>

287
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:14,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, to get cracking with my delivery.</font>

288
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Deliver...</font>

289
00:18:23,350 --> 00:18:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will deliver.</font>

290
00:18:26,100 --> 00:18:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, where are you going?
Play with me.</font>

291
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:35,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no! Not that way.</font>

292
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do my best!</font>

293
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys! Give me a hand!</font>

294
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right! Yeah.
— Okay!</font>

295
00:19:01,570 --> 00:19:04,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Postal delivery.</font>

